            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.0.7 — Faster, and your colors</h3>
<ul>
<li>Custom space colors: click the icon next to a space's name and pick colors on the new color pad. Add up to three for a gradient, and set how strongly they show.</li>
<li>Tabs you haven't looked at in 10 minutes now sleep, freeing memory and battery. They reload when you click them.</li>
<li>The moving background uses less power and pauses when Pane is in the background.</li>
<li>Pages appear a little sooner, and saving your tabs never slows down typing or scrolling.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
